# 🛍️ FashionStore — Java Full Stack E-Commerce Web Application

> A complete, fully-functional fashion e-commerce platform built from scratch
> using Java Servlets, JSP, MySQL and Apache Tomcat 10.1.
> Follows MVC Design Pattern with DAO + DAOImpl architecture.

