## ✨ Features

### 👤 User Features
- ✅ User Registration with BCrypt Password Hashing
- ✅ Secure Login and Logout with Session Management
- ✅ User Profile Management
- ✅ Browse Products by Category
  - Women | Men | Kids | Ethnic Wear | Accessories
- ✅ Search Products by Name and Description
- ✅ Filter Products by Category and Price Range
- ✅ Sort Products by Price and Name
- ✅ Product Detail Page with Size Selection and Stock Info
- ✅ Add to Cart, Update Quantity, Remove from Cart
- ✅ Checkout with Delivery Address
- ✅ Multiple Payment Options
  - Cash on Delivery | UPI | Credit/Debit Card | Net Banking
- ✅ Order Placement and Confirmation
- ✅ Order History
- ✅ Order Tracking with Visual Progress Bar
- ✅ Wishlist — Add, Remove, View

### ⚙️ Admin Features
- ✅ Admin Dashboard
  - Total Products | Total Orders | Total Users | Total Revenue
- ✅ Product Management
  - Add New Product | Edit Product | Delete Product (Soft Delete)
- ✅ Order Management
  - View All Orders | Update Order Status
- ✅ User Management
  - View All Registered Users

### 🎨 UI Features
- ✅ Ocean Blue Professional Theme
- ✅ Fully Responsive Design
- ✅ JavaScript Form Validations
- ✅ Password Strength Meter
- ✅ Real-time Field Error Messages
- ✅ Order Tracking Progress Bar with Pulse Animation
- ✅ Product Image Gallery with Real Images
- ✅ Custom Error Pages (404 and 500)

---

## 🔧 Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| **Language** | Java 21 |
| **Backend** | Jakarta Servlets (Jakarta EE 5.0) |
| **Frontend** | JSP, JSTL, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript |
| **Database** | MySQL 8.0 |
| **Server** | Apache Tomcat 10.1 |
| **Build Tool** | Apache Maven |
| **Security** | BCrypt Password Hashing (jBCrypt) |
| **IDE** | Eclipse IDE |
| **Design Pattern** | MVC (Model-View-Controller) |
| **DB Pattern** | DAO + DAOImpl |

---

## 🗄️ Database Schema

| Table | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `users` | User accounts and profiles |
| `categories` | Product categories |
| `products` | Product catalog with details |
| `product_variants` | Product sizes and stock |
| `cart` | User shopping cart |
| `cart_items` | Items inside cart |
| `orders` | Placed orders with delivery info |
| `order_items` | Individual items in each order |
| `wishlist` | User saved products |

